4. HMOFA Anthronomicon & Masterlist

The HMOFA Anthronomicon (`https://alpharius6769.github.io/hmofa-story-index/`) is
an interactive story index authored and maintained by Chris (Alpharius67 / Fluffarius).
It is embedded within Pocket Reader with an app-specific postMessage interceptor and
fetch wrapper for seamless in-app story loading. The standalone live HMOFA web app
operates independently for public users. Individual stories remain the property of
their respective authors.

